{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-aac21b4df09a00db","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nAll checks complete. The story files (package.json, test/package.test.cjs, package-lock.json, .gitignore change) were introduced in commit `6cc5d66`, match the working tree exactly, all 4 tests pass, and git status shows only orchestrator housekeeping outside story scope.\n\n# Code Review — STORY-setup-001a: Root NextMove package.json with Workspaces\n\n**Scope reviewed:** commit `6cc5d66` (story files: `package.json`, `test/package.test.cjs`, `package-lock.json`, `.gitignore`), committed state at HEAD, and working-tree consistency.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Verification (field-by-field)\n\n| AC | Field | Value in `package.json` | Status |\n|----|-------|------------------------|--------|\n| 1 | `name` | `\"nextmove\"` | pass |\n| 1 | `private` | `true` | pass |\n| 1 | `workspaces` | `[\"apps/*\"]` | pass |\n| 1 | `packageManager` | `\"npm@10\"` | pass |\n| 1 | `engines.node` | `\"22.x\"` | pass |\n| 2 | `devDependencies.turbo` | `\"^2.5.0\"` (2.x) | pass |\n| 2 | `scripts.build` | `\"turbo run build\"` | pass |\n| 2 | `scripts.test` | `\"turbo run test\"` | pass |\n| 2 | `scripts.lint` | `\"turbo run lint\"` | pass |\n| 3 | committed to git, clean | `git diff HEAD` on story files empty; commit exists; git commands exit 0 | pass |\n\n## Test Quality Check (`/test/package.test.cjs`)\n\n- Uses `node:test` + `node:assert/strict` — non-vacuous, asserts exact values (`assert.equal` on `^2.5.0`, `npm@10`, `22.x`, and each script string).\n- Would fail correctly on regressions: wrong `name`, dropped `apps/*` workspace, turbo 3.x, or a missing/altered script each breaks a distinct assertion.\n- Ran `node --test test/package.test.cjs`: **4/4 pass, 0 fail, exit 0.**\n\n## Supporting Files\n\n- `package-lock.json`: `lockfileVersion: 3` (sane), root entry mirrors `devDependencies.turbo: ^2.5.0`, and the `node_modules/turbo` entry at `2.10.11`